  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3205.04 Conversion of Allowances to Discrete Emission Reductions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3205.04 Conversion of Allowances to Discrete Emission Reductions. A budget source that converts unused allowances to discrete emission reductions (DERs) in accordance with the procedures for DER generation in Env-A 3103, shall surrender those converted allowances as if they had been used for actual emissions.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
